# INVWINCB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the file name
# dialog of Export CSV.  It opens on C:\RUN, listing its files *.CSV,
# its directories and the drives; a directory chosen in the list goes
# into the name with the pattern, and OK lists it; a directory typed, as
# .. and as a name, is listed too; a pattern after a directory lists its
# files from then on; a directory or a drive that does not exist and a
# path longer than the form's file are refused on the message line; DATA
# listed last, then Cancel.  Opened again it starts on C:\RUN, as the
# dialog gave the program's directory back, and a file typed after a
# directory lists
# that directory and goes into the form as a path; Cancel in the form;
# the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINCB.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A E
S START
K TAB HOME DOWN DOWN DOWN
S CHOSEN
K ENTER
S INDATA
T ..
K ENTER
S UP
T DATA
K ENTER
S TYPED
T ..\*.MSG
K ENTER
S PATTERN
T NOSUCH\X.CSV
K ENTER
S NODIR
T Q:
K ENTER
S NODRIVE
T ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZABCDEFG.CSV
K ENTER
S LONG
T DATA
K ENTER
S LAST
K ESC
S CANCEL
K ALT-A E
S REOPEN
T DATA\CBX.CSV
K ENTER
S FORM
K ESC
S DONE
K ALT-F X
